00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:47.519
<v Marcus Hale>Shame. Could do with a bit of magic on the ring road as well.</v>

00:06:48.939 --> 00:06:55.589
<v Tomasz Nowak>Right, that's us. Finished work stays finished, blocked work stays blocked, and the agreed bits are clear. Thanks, everyone.</v>
